            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/sheaf"} sheaf
            itself, but for more details on
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/sheaf"} sheaves
            themselves see there.
          %h2#definition Definition
          %p
            Let
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
